    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Real Estate theme provides a comprehensive and professional solution for building websites for real estate agents, brokers, developers, property consultants, property marketers, and real estate agencies. It features One Click Demo Import for quick setup, fully responsive design, customizable banners, property listings, and easy property management tools. WooCommerce support enables selling property reports, real estate guides, and digital marketing resources, while Contact Form 7 ensures lead capture and client inquiries, and Yoast SEO boosts search visibility for keywords like real estate theme, property listing template, realtor website, real estate agency template, property portal, apartment listings, villa showcase, commercial property website, luxury property site, and real estate marketplace. The theme integrates seamlessly with Easy Property Listings and other popular plugins, supports residential, commercial, luxury properties, apartments, villas, plots, office spaces, retail leasing, and vacation rentals, and offers SEO-optimized layouts, fast performance, and a clean design to enhance lead generation, property branding, and conversions, making it a polished, high-performing, and user-friendly platform for real estate professionals and property marketplaces."
    },
